flowchart LR
    Browser[User browser]

    subgraph GitHub[GitHub]
        Pages[GitHub Pages\nReact + Vite frontend\n/static assets]
        Actions[GitHub Actions\nCI: typecheck + build\nPages: build + deploy]
        Repo[(mosang\nsource repository)]
    end

    subgraph Railway[Railway production service]
        API[Fastify Node.js API\nHTTPS public domain\n0.0.0.0:$PORT]
        OAuth[OAuth callbacks\nGitHub / Google]
        MCP[Streamable HTTP MCP\n/mcp + Bearer token]
        Volume[(Railway Volume\n/app/data)]
        SQLite[(SQLite\nscrolltell.db)]
        API --> OAuth
        API --> MCP
        API --> Volume
        Volume --> SQLite
    end

    GitHubOAuth[GitHub OAuth]
    GoogleOAuth[Google OAuth]
    Claude[Claude / Claude Code]
    Manus[Manus custom MCP connector]

    Browser -->|HTTPS loads app| Pages
    Pages -->|HTTPS REST + cookies\nVITE_API_URL| API
    Browser -->|OAuth redirect| OAuth
    OAuth -->|authorize| GitHubOAuth
    OAuth -->|authorize| GoogleOAuth
    GitHubOAuth -->|callback| OAuth
    GoogleOAuth -->|callback| OAuth
    Claude -->|HTTPS MCP + bearer token| MCP
    Manus -->|HTTPS MCP + bearer token| MCP
    Repo --> Actions
    Actions -->|deploy static artifact| Pages
    Actions -.->|does not host API or DB| Railway

